<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dust Devil</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 9)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast dust devil</a>
</pre>
<p>Summons a dust devil, a tiny whirling elemental, to guard you. It follows you 
around, joins in when you fight, and when your hit points drop below a third 
it tries to rescue you.
</p><p>It doesn't stay long: from half a minute to a minute and a half, longer the 
better your summoning sphere. Then it vanishes in a puff of smoke, dropping 
whatever it carried. It doesn't take orders.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Earth</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>